		{
			description: [
				"&8▸&r 制作一个 <grad from=#7A8F96 to=#E6F2F5 f=0 sp=12 uni>空瓶</grad>。"
				""
				"&8▸&r 在 <grad from=#6B2020 to=#C96A5A f=0 sp=16 uni>废弃实验室</grad> 中搜寻 <grad from=#0A3D1F to=#7CFF8A f=0 sp=12 uni>外星黏液</grad>。"
				""
				"&8▸&r 手持小瓶右键凝胶即可填充。"
				""
				"&8▸&r 在熔炉中冶炼 <grad from=#2E6B3A to=#A8E8B0 f=0 sp=12 uni>填充瓶</grad> 以获取 <grad from=#8A6A12 to=#FFD75E f=0 sp=12 uni>DNA 瓶</grad>。"
				""
				"&8▸&r Right-click the <grad from=#8A6A12 to=#FFD75E f=0 sp=12 uni>DNA Vial</grad> with the <grad from=#1B5E20 to=#5BFF2A f=0.6 sp=12 uni>Omnitrix</grad> on your wrist to unlock <grad from=#0A3D1F to=#7CFF8A f=0.8 sp=12 uni>Opticoid</grad>."
			]
